{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "89ae4d0d957a82d9b92e00d94eb64780ff1224714770f517f8d23ccab20c1a31", "ja": "大団円はバラの紅茶で", "zh": "在大团圆结局品味玫瑰红茶", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e82891af77daec350b2471d4e7dd92ac7fdc41a1b3749390a8f861ffd636b8b9", "ja": "正統派続編と番外編の同時上演は大成功。\r\n夜想令嬢のファンイベントは大好評のうちに\r\n幕を下ろした。控室に戻ったアイドル達は\r\n互いの健闘を称えつつ、伊織の持ってきた\r\nローズティーとスコーンを楽しむのだった。", "zh": "正统派续作与番外篇同时上演，大获成功。\n夜想令嬢的粉丝活动在一片好评中\n落下了帷幕。回到休息室的偶像们\n一边称赞彼此的奋战，一边享用了\n伊织带来的玫瑰茶和司康。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1000_se", "source_sha256": "5bc69e5b1c1ad7ceead171d240a9d31173ed372760ba22fbc0b5aa7947d8d15c", "ja": "パチパチパチパチ……", "zh": "啪啪啪啪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "c8efcdb8e2fdedeb679eebf0444c35b624ac25e9482de1faaa195faa29405d20", "ja": "（『昏き星、遠い月』正統派続編とはっちゃけ番外編。\n豪華2本立ての朗読劇は、お客さんのウケも良く……）", "zh": "（《昏暗之星，遥远之月》的正统续篇和热闹的番外篇。豪华的2本朗读剧也很受观众欢迎……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1002_p", "source_sha256": "560d2028a9bdd739f3dbb171a25be57f04de15e573541be503a8d9c9ccfba505", "ja": "（夜想令嬢のファンイベントは、\n大好評のうちに幕を閉じた……）", "zh": "（夜想令嬢的粉丝活动在一片好评中落下了帷幕……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1003_020meg", "source_sha256": "f96e7d4902a2dfb7c3381c70e2c92f2889b3c9494fe6ceff36ea71a7c027d147", "ja": "は～～～、やりきった～！\nみんな、ホントお疲れ！", "zh": "哈——总算完成了～！\n大家，真的辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1004_031tom", "source_sha256": "2af499e0c05435aa152bed537d423c77dc54da45eb8326bbe312b300ba8094f6", "ja": "最初の予定から朗読劇が1本増えて、準備期間も\n大忙しでしたからね～。よく頑張りました～♪", "zh": "从最初的计划多加了1场朗读剧，准备期间也是忙得不可开交呢～。大家都辛苦啦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "4df10e133b21961f4a4c68904a360c2c6c2fdfc140c0aafee61fe69f70e91e24", "ja": "朗読劇2本にライブパートもこなして、\nもう、体がバッキバキよ。明日はマッサージ行こっと。", "zh": "朗读剧2场加上演唱会部分都搞定了，身体都快散架了。明天去按摩放松一下。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1006_038chz", "source_sha256": "dbb196e8d687c637f03129d0bd73bea68e052f56601097cb9c02918060b52e76", "ja": "わたくしも、明日は近所のスーパー銭湯……\nではなく！　超高級スパで、くつろぎますわ！？", "zh": "我也打算明天去附近的超级浴池……\n不对！要去超高级水疗中心好好放松一下呢！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1007_046rio", "source_sha256": "bafb1f30e675d5c958b4b4007645bddbbe150b2cdbf1f22fb639782ef44f306c", "ja": "あら、だったら千鶴ちゃん、私と一緒に行かない？\nすっごくいいところがあるのよ～♪", "zh": "哎呀，那千鹤要不要和我一起去？我知道一个特别棒的地方哦～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1008_038chz", "source_sha256": "821a8ada22a15171e693a4b8ab305955f69263653c7f15c26760374302b9ae0c", "ja": "まあ、いいんですの？　莉緒さんのお勧め、\nぜひご一緒させていただきたいですわ！", "zh": "哎呀，可以吗？莉绪小姐推荐的地方，\n我十分乐意奉陪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1009_007ior", "source_sha256": "37e8464d2c2b328d809b714ceec75b3a84f141816cca33e9bbbe7626cd858d98", "ja": "ねえ、ところでみんな、お腹は空いてない？\n私、家からいいものを持ってきたの。", "zh": "对了，大家肚子饿不饿？我从家里带了些好东西来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "1d2a091ed353b641aca18cb389882f71c047056310b7a10e854d60b60849083b", "ja": "いいもの？", "zh": "好东西？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1011_007ior", "source_sha256": "9de51a532a060b3a0ce0055c4c25b3ce887ce931b03138105ae368168fa92b52", "ja": "ええ！　今回のお話にちなんで、\nローズティーとバラのスコーンよ。素敵でしょ♪", "zh": "是的！配合这次的故事，我准备了玫瑰茶和玫瑰司康。很棒吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1012_020meg", "source_sha256": "026bbd91360d6384061da858c9886ae21c1e48223ddf455334244416463fd3c8", "ja": "わ～！　このスコーン、ピンク色だ！\n中に入ってるのって、バラの花？", "zh": "哇～！这个司康饼是粉色的！\n里面加的是玫瑰花吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1013_031tom", "source_sha256": "2c51aa1e50a24365574b9bc6ae6c30dca9f5ed6c5e6a45130bfe86512340fde9", "ja": "食用のバラが使われているんですね～。\n私たちの考えた番外編に、ぴったりなおやつです～。", "zh": "原来用的是食用玫瑰呢～。\n这真是非常适合我们想出的番外篇的点心呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1014_038chz", "source_sha256": "49803f3565517b5e8c0449eb06050aad9d1c8662cb27be44294c0989fd471d82", "ja": "では、わたくしがティーを淹れて参りますわ。\n良いかしら？　伊織。", "zh": "那么，我来为大家泡茶吧。\n可以吗？伊织。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1015_007ior", "source_sha256": "683c83a5045a0f42854ce51f944b551fe73fa0c2ae6956087dbc96fc02a922c6", "ja": "ありがと、千鶴♪\n千鶴の淹れる紅茶って、不思議とおいしいのよね～。", "zh": "谢谢你，千鹤♪  \n千鹤泡的红茶，总觉得格外好喝呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1016_046rio", "source_sha256": "793b0bc79c8e7f489c2b944e3159243854b98602dc516bff004553549a5162c3", "ja": "紅茶とスコーンかぁ。それも素敵だけど、\n私はやっぱり大人の麦茶で天国に……♪", "zh": "红茶和司康啊。那也很不错，不过我果然还是想靠大人的麦茶上天堂……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0bac416ed38d70c52c2d3cfd36ea295cc3703ae91948a65173af0f09ddf43da0", "ja": "莉緒……。", "zh": "莉绪……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1018_046rio", "source_sha256": "b0504b3dfef287ca233008a2532f695cbf93f46a8cbb082018d535c8d6730807", "ja": "……な、なんてね！　仲間外れは寂しいし、\n私もみんなとローズティーで乾杯するわ！", "zh": "……开、开玩笑的啦！落单了会很寂寞的，\n我也要和大家一起用玫瑰茶干杯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "fe7ea4d3008e497bfcbb59e757b97c508b9db6e4d2c30191b1fffd57df482c25", "ja": "（今頃ヴァンパイア達は、旅を続けているのか。\nそれとも約束の地でバラの紅茶を飲んでいるのか……）", "zh": "（不知道吸血鬼们现在还在继续旅行，还是已经在约定之地喝玫瑰茶了……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0245_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0245_story_05_1020_p", "source_sha256": "9df1df5275024f249c22c800e49fdb2a480920737774f453bb6edd08899620e9", "ja": "（みんなやお客さん達と同じように、\n幸せな気持ちでいてくれるといいな）", "zh": "希望他们也能和大家、客人们一样，心里感到幸福就好了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
